---
import '@fontsource-variable/bricolage-grotesque/standard.css';
import '@fontsource-variable/inter';
import Work from '../components/c/Work.tsx';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Oliver Martínez Haro — Producto, interfaz y edge</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Diseño y construyo productos web cuidados hasta el último milisegundo, desplegados en Cloudflare."
    />
    <link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
  </head>
  <body class="d-c">
    <a class="c-skip" href="#trabajo">Saltar al trabajo</a>
    <div class="c-aurora" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <header class="c-nav">
      <a class="c-nav-brand" href="/c">
        <img src="/icon.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" />
        <span>Oliver Martínez Haro</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="c-nav-links" aria-label="Secciones">
        <a href="#trabajo">Trabajo</a>
        <a href="#servicios">Servicios</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/martinezharo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="c-nav-cta" href="#contacto">Hablemos</a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="c-hero">
        <div class="c-hero-copy">
          <p class="c-pill"><i></i>Acepto un proyecto para septiembre</p>
          <h1>
            Interfaces que se sienten
            <span class="c-grad">bien construidas</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="c-hero-lede">
            Diseño y programo productos web enteros: la investigación, la pantalla, el código y el
            despliegue en Cloudflare. Si la interacción no se siente bien, todavía no está
            terminada.
          </p>
          <div class="c-hero-cta">
            <a class="c-btn" href="#contacto">Empezar un proyecto</a>
            <a class="c-btn c-btn--ghost" href="#trabajo">Ver ocho ejemplos</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Señal: la pieza del hero es una superficie que responde al cursor.
             Es la demostración, no una ilustración. -->
        <div class="c-chip" data-tilt>
          <span class="c-chip-sheen" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <img src="/icon.svg" alt="Marca de Oliver Martínez Haro" width="120" height="120" />
          <span class="c-chip-face">
            <b>Muévete por encima</b>
            <span>Esto es lo que quiero decir con «se siente bien»</span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="c-band" aria-label="Cifras">
        <div><b>8</b><span>productos en producción</span></div>
        <div><b>2023</b><span>trabajando por mi cuenta</span></div>
        <div><b>41 ms</b><span>TTFB mediano en Europa</span></div>
        <div><b>&lt;24 h</b><span>en contestar un mensaje</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="c-section" id="trabajo">
        <div class="c-sechead">
          <div>
            <p class="c-eyebrow">Trabajo</p>
            <h2>Ocho proyectos, cuatro medidas cada uno</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            Craft, depth, utility e impact van de 0 a 100 y los pongo yo, con criterio y sin
            maquillaje. Pasa el cursor por una medida para ver qué significa.
          </p>
        </div>
        <Work client:load />
      </section>

      <section class="c-section c-services" id="servicios">
        <div class="c-sechead">
          <div>
            <p class="c-eyebrow">Servicios</p>
            <h2>En qué puedo ayudarte</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="c-cards">
          <article>
            <span class="c-svc-ico" aria-hidden="true">◐</span>
            <h3>Diseño de producto e interfaz</h3>
            <p>
              Del mapa de pantallas al sistema de componentes. Prototipo en el navegador con tu
              contenido real, porque es donde se ven de verdad los problemas.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span class="c-svc-ico" aria-hidden="true">◈</span>
            <h3>Desarrollo web completo</h3>
            <p>
              Astro, React y TypeScript sobre Cloudflare Workers, D1 y R2. Un solo runtime del
              navegador a la base de datos, con despliegues de segundos.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span class="c-svc-ico" aria-hidden="true">◎</span>
            <h3>Rescate de rendimiento</h3>
            <p>
              Si tu sitio ya existe pero va lento, lo mido, te digo qué lo frena y lo arreglo.
              Presupuesto cerrado y antes/después con números.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="c-section c-contact" id="contacto">
        <div class="c-contact-card">
          <div class="c-contact-lead">
            <img class="c-avatar" src="/imgs/portrait.jpg" alt="Oliver Martínez Haro" width="72" height="72" />
            <div>
              <h2>Cuéntame qué quieres construir</h2>
              <p>
                Contesto en menos de 24 horas con una estimación honesta o con un no. Si no encaja
                conmigo, te digo con quién sí.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <form class="c-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault()">
            <div class="c-row">
              <div class="c-field">
                <input id="c-name" type="text" placeholder=" " required />
                <label for="c-name">Nombre</label>
              </div>
              <div class="c-field">
                <input id="c-mail" type="email" placeholder=" " required />
                <label for="c-mail">Email</label>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="c-field">
              <textarea id="c-msg" rows="4" placeholder=" " required></textarea>
              <label for="c-msg">Qué quieres construir y para cuándo</label>
            </div>
            <div class="c-form-foot">
              <button class="c-btn" type="submit">Enviar mensaje</button>
              <a class="c-mail" href="mailto:hola@olivermartinezharo.com">
                o escribe a hola@olivermartinezharo.com
              </a>
            </div>
          </form>

          <a class="c-ghcard" href="https://github.com/martinezharo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="19" height="19" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                fill="currentColor"
                d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27s1.36.09 2 .27c1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.01 8.01 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8Z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            <span>
              <b>github.com/martinezharo</b>
              El código de casi todo esto está abierto
            </span>
            <em aria-hidden="true">↗</em>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer class="c-foot">
        <span>© 2026 Oliver Martínez Haro</span>
        <span>Astro · React · Cloudflare Workers</span>
      </footer>
    </main>

    <script>
      // El mismo tilt que usan las tarjetas, para las superficies del layout.
      if (!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) {
        document.addEventListener(
          'pointermove',
          (e) => {
            const el = (e.target as HTMLElement).closest<HTMLElement>('[data-tilt]');
            if (!el) return;
            const b = el.getBoundingClientRect();
            el.style.setProperty('--mx', `${((e.clientX - b.left) / b.width) * 100}%`);
            el.style.setProperty('--my', `${((e.clientY - b.top) / b.height) * 100}%`);
            el.style.setProperty('--tx', `${((e.clientX - b.left) / b.width - 0.5) * 2}`);
            el.style.setProperty('--ty', `${((e.clientY - b.top) / b.height - 0.5) * 2}`);
          },
          { passive: true },
        );
      }
    </script>

    <style is:global>
      .d-c {
        --void: #0b0a12;
        --surface: #17151f;
        --surface-2: #1e1b29;
        --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        --line-2: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
        --text: #eae7f6;
        --muted: #8f88a8;
        --iris: #7a5cff;
        --coral: #ff8a5b;
        --aqua: #57e2c8;

        --spring: linear(
          0,
          0.16 3.2%,
          0.63 8.7%,
          0.9 13.5%,
          1.03 18.4%,
          1.06 24.2%,
          1.01 33.5%,
          0.998 45%,
          1
        );

        --gut: clamp(20px, 5vw, 64px);
        --disp: 'Bricolage Grotesque Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;
        --body: 'Inter Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;

        margin: 0;
        background: var(--void);
        color: var(--muted);
        font-family: var(--body);
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }
      .d-c *,
      .d-c *::before,
      .d-c *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      .d-c h1,
      .d-c h2,
      .d-c h3,
      .d-c p {
        margin: 0;
      }
      /* :where() deja el reset en especificidad cero, así los componentes que
         vienen después pueden fijar su propio color sin pelear. */
      .d-c :where(a) {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .d-c :where(img) {
        display: block;
        max-width: 100%;
      }
      .d-c :focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--iris);
        outline-offset: 3px;
      }
      .c-skip {
        position: absolute;
        left: -9999px;
      }
      .c-skip:focus {
        left: 14px;
        top: 14px;
        z-index: 60;
        background: var(--iris);
        color: #fff;
        padding: 10px 16px;
        border-radius: 10px;
      }

      .c-aurora {
        position: fixed;
        inset: -30% -10% auto;
        height: 780px;
        z-index: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        background:
          radial-gradient(46% 52% at 22% 40%, rgba(122, 92, 255, 0.34), transparent 70%),
          radial-gradient(40% 46% at 74% 26%, rgba(255, 138, 91, 0.22), transparent 70%),
          radial-gradient(34% 40% at 52% 66%, rgba(87, 226, 200, 0.14), transparent 70%);
        filter: blur(60px);
      }
      .d-c main,
      .d-c .c-nav {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .c-eyebrow {
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--iris);
      }

      /* ── Barra superior ───────────────────────────────────────── */
      .c-nav {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 30;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 14px var(--gut);
        background: rgba(11, 10, 18, 0.72);
        backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(1.4);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .c-nav-brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 11px;
        font-family: var(--disp);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 15px;
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .c-nav-brand img {
        width: 26px;
        height: 26px;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }
      .c-nav-links {
        display: none;
        margin-left: auto;
        gap: 30px;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      @media (min-width: 820px) {
        .c-nav-links {
          display: flex;
        }
      }
      .c-nav-links a:hover {
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .c-nav-cta {
        margin-left: auto;
        padding: 9px 18px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        color: var(--text);
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s, transform 0.3s var(--spring);
      }
      @media (min-width: 820px) {
        .c-nav-cta {
          margin-left: 0;
        }
      }
      .c-nav-cta:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        border-color: var(--line-2);
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }

      /* ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .c-hero {
        display: grid;
        gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);
        align-items: center;
        padding: clamp(52px, 8vw, 108px) var(--gut) clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px);
      }
      @media (min-width: 940px) {
        .c-hero {
          grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(300px, 0.85fr);
        }
      }
      .c-pill {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 9px;
        padding: 7px 15px 7px 12px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: #b6afcd;
      }
      .c-pill i {
        width: 7px;
        height: 7px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--aqua);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(87, 226, 200, 0.5);
        animation: c-ping 2.6s ease-out infinite;
      }
      @keyframes c-ping {
        50% {
          box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(87, 226, 200, 0);
        }
      }
      .c-hero h1 {
        margin-top: 26px;
        font-family: var(--disp);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 78px);
        line-height: 1.02;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
        color: var(--text);
        font-stretch: 96%;
        text-wrap: balance;
      }
      .c-grad {
        display: block;
        background: linear-gradient(96deg, var(--iris) 8%, var(--coral) 58%, var(--aqua) 96%);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
      }
      .c-hero-lede {
        margin-top: 24px;
        max-width: 48ch;
        font-size: clamp(16px, 1.3vw, 18px);
        color: #a49dbd;
        text-wrap: pretty;
      }
      .c-hero-cta {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 34px;
      }
      .c-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        height: 50px;
        padding: 0 26px;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8b6dff, #6a4af0);
        color: #fff;
        font-family: var(--body);
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 600;
        cursor: pointer;
        box-shadow:
          inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35),
          0 10px 24px -8px rgba(122, 92, 255, 0.7);
        transition: transform 0.45s var(--spring), box-shadow 0.3s;
      }
      .c-btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow:
          inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4),
          0 16px 32px -10px rgba(122, 92, 255, 0.8);
      }
      .c-btn:active {
        transform: translateY(1px) scale(0.985);
      }
      .c-btn--ghost {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
        color: var(--text);
        box-shadow: none;
      }
      .c-btn--ghost:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
        box-shadow: none;
      }

      /* Superficie táctil del hero. */
      .c-chip {
        --mx: 50%;
        --my: 50%;
        --tx: 0;
        --ty: 0;
        position: relative;
        display: grid;
        justify-items: center;
        gap: 22px;
        padding: clamp(34px, 4vw, 52px) 30px;
        border-radius: 30px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
        background:
          radial-gradient(120% 120% at 50% 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09), transparent 60%),
          linear-gradient(165deg, var(--surface-2), #131120);
        box-shadow:
          inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14),
          0 40px 80px -30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
        overflow: hidden;
        transform: perspective(900px) rotateY(calc(var(--tx) * 6deg))
          rotateX(calc(var(--ty) * -6deg));
        transition: transform 0.5s var(--spring);
      }
      .c-chip-sheen {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(
          220px 220px at var(--mx) var(--my),
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14),
          transparent 70%
        );
        opacity: 0;
        transition: opacity 0.35s;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .c-chip:hover .c-chip-sheen {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      .c-chip img {
        width: clamp(96px, 12vw, 140px);
        height: auto;
        border-radius: 28px;
        box-shadow: 0 22px 50px -18px rgba(122, 92, 255, 0.85);
      }
      .c-chip-face {
        display: grid;
        gap: 4px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .c-chip-face b {
        font-family: var(--disp);
        font-size: 17px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .c-chip-face span {
        font-size: 13.5px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      /* ── Banda de cifras ──────────────────────────────────────── */
      .c-band {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 1px;
        margin: 0 var(--gut);
        border-radius: 22px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: var(--line);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      @media (min-width: 800px) {
        .c-band {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        }
      }
      .c-band > div {
        display: grid;
        gap: 3px;
        padding: 22px 24px;
        background: rgba(23, 21, 31, 0.7);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      }
      .c-band b {
        font-family: var(--disp);
        font-size: clamp(26px, 2.6vw, 34px);
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.1;
      }
      .c-band span {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      /* ── Secciones ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .c-section {
        padding: clamp(60px, 8vw, 108px) var(--gut);
      }
      .c-sechead {
        display: grid;
        gap: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 34px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 900px) {
        .c-sechead {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr minmax(0, 44ch);
          align-items: end;
          gap: 48px;
        }
      }
      .c-sechead h2 {
        margin-top: 10px;
        font-family: var(--disp);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 46px);
        line-height: 1.06;
        letter-spacing: -0.032em;
        color: var(--text);
        text-wrap: balance;
      }
      .c-sechead > p {
        font-size: 15px;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-wrap: pretty;
      }

      /* ── Controles ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .c-controls {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 10px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: rgba(23, 21, 31, 0.66);
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      }
      .c-seg {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        gap: 2px;
        padding: 4px;
        border-radius: 13px;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32);
      }
      .c-seg-pill {
        position: absolute;
        top: 4px;
        bottom: 4px;
        left: 0;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8b6dff, #6a4af0);
        box-shadow:
          inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3),
          0 6px 14px -6px rgba(122, 92, 255, 0.9);
        transition: transform 0.55s var(--spring), width 0.55s var(--spring), opacity 0.2s;
      }
      .c-seg button {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        border: 0;
        background: none;
        padding: 8px 16px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-family: var(--body);
        font-size: 13.5px;
        font-weight: 500;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: color 0.25s;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .c-seg button:hover {
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .c-seg button[data-on='true'] {
        color: #fff;
      }

      .c-chips {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 7px;
      }
      .c-chips button {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        padding: 8px 15px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-family: var(--body);
        font-size: 13.5px;
        font-weight: 500;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.35s var(--spring);
      }
      .c-chips button:hover {
        color: var(--text);
        border-color: var(--line-2);
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }
      .c-chips button.is-on {
        color: #0c0a14;
        background: var(--aqua);
        border-color: var(--aqua);
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .c-sort {
        position: relative;
        margin-left: auto;
      }
      .c-sort-trigger {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 9px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        padding: 9px 16px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        color: var(--text);
        font-family: var(--body);
        font-size: 13.5px;
        font-weight: 500;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
      }
      .c-sort-trigger:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
        border-color: var(--line-2);
      }
      .c-sort-trigger svg {
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .c-pop {
        position: absolute;
        top: calc(100% + 8px);
        right: 0;
        z-index: 25;
        min-width: 214px;
        padding: 6px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
        background: #16141f;
        box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
        display: grid;
        gap: 1px;
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(-6px) scale(0.97);
        transform-origin: top right;
        pointer-events: none;
        transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.4s var(--spring);
      }
      .c-pop.is-open {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: none;
        pointer-events: auto;
      }
      .c-pop button {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px;
        width: 100%;
        border: 0;
        background: none;
        padding: 9px 12px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-family: var(--body);
        font-size: 13.5px;
        font-weight: 500;
        text-align: left;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.16s, color 0.16s;
      }
      .c-pop button:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .c-pop button.is-on {
        color: var(--aqua);
      }

      .c-tally {
        margin: 16px 2px 20px;
        font-size: 13.5px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .c-tally b {
        color: var(--text);
      }

      /* ── Tarjetas ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .c-grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 16px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 720px) {
        .c-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }
      }
      @media (min-width: 1200px) {
        .c-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        }
      }
      .c-card {
        --mx: 50%;
        --my: 50%;
        --tx: 0;
        --ty: 0;
        position: relative;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-rows: auto auto auto 1fr auto auto;
        gap: 0;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 24px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: linear-gradient(168deg, rgba(30, 27, 41, 0.9), rgba(19, 17, 28, 0.9));
        box-shadow:
          inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07),
          0 20px 40px -26px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
        overflow: hidden;
        transform: perspective(1000px) rotateY(calc(var(--tx) * 2.4deg))
          rotateX(calc(var(--ty) * -2.4deg));
        transition:
          transform 0.5s var(--spring),
          border-color 0.3s,
          box-shadow 0.3s;
      }
      .c-card:hover {
        border-color: var(--line-2);
        box-shadow:
          inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12),
          0 30px 60px -28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 1);
      }
      .c-card-sheen {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(
          260px 260px at var(--mx) var(--my),
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07),
          transparent 68%
        );
        opacity: 0;
        transition: opacity 0.3s;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .c-card:hover .c-card-sheen {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      .c-card-top {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .c-card-logo {
        width: 46px;
        height: 46px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 18px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
      }
      .c-card-logo img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }
      .c-card-state {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 7px;
        padding: 5px 11px 5px 9px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        font-size: 11.5px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--muted);
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .c-card-state i {
        width: 6px;
        height: 6px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #575070;
      }
      .c-card-state[data-live='true'] {
        color: var(--aqua);
        border-color: rgba(87, 226, 200, 0.28);
        background: rgba(87, 226, 200, 0.08);
      }
      .c-card-state[data-live='true'] i {
        background: var(--aqua);
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--aqua);
      }
      .c-card-name {
        margin-top: 18px;
        font-family: var(--disp);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 22px;
        letter-spacing: -0.025em;
        line-height: 1.15;
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .c-card-kind {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-top: 8px;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .c-tag {
        padding: 3px 9px;
        border-radius: 7px;
        background: rgba(122, 92, 255, 0.16);
        color: #b3a1ff;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .c-card-blurb {
        margin-top: 13px;
        font-size: 13.5px;
        line-height: 1.55;
        color: #9a93b2;
        text-wrap: pretty;
      }

      .c-card-scores {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding-top: 18px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .c-dial {
        position: relative;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        flex: none;
      }
      .c-dial svg {
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        transform: rotate(-90deg);
      }
      .c-dial-track {
        fill: none;
        stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        stroke-width: 6;
      }
      .c-dial-arc {
        fill: none;
        stroke: url(#c-dial-grad);
        stroke: var(--aqua);
        stroke-width: 6;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        transition: stroke-dashoffset 0.8s var(--spring);
      }
      .c-dial b {
        position: absolute;
        font-family: var(--disp);
        font-size: 19px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .c-bars {
        display: grid;
        gap: 5px;
        flex: 1;
        min-width: 0;
      }
      .c-bar {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr 22px;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 9px;
        cursor: help;
      }
      .c-bar-key {
        font-size: 10.5px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #6f6889;
      }
      .c-bar-rail {
        height: 5px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .c-bar-rail i {
        display: block;
        height: 100%;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--iris), var(--coral));
        transition: width 0.7s var(--spring);
      }
      .c-bar-val {
        font-size: 11.5px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-align: right;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      }

      .c-card-foot {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 18px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #6f6889;
      }
      .c-card-go {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--muted);
        transition: color 0.2s, gap 0.35s var(--spring);
      }
      .c-card:hover .c-card-go {
        color: var(--text);
        gap: 10px;
      }
      .c-empty {
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding: 34px;
        text-align: center;
        border: 1px dashed var(--line-2);
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 14.5px;
      }

      /* ── Servicios ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .c-cards {
        display: grid;
        gap: 16px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 860px) {
        .c-cards {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        }
      }
      .c-cards article {
        padding: 28px 26px 30px;
        border-radius: 24px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: linear-gradient(168deg, rgba(30, 27, 41, 0.85), rgba(19, 17, 28, 0.85));
        box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      }
      .c-svc-ico {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        width: 44px;
        height: 44px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: rgba(122, 92, 255, 0.16);
        color: #b3a1ff;
        font-size: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }
      .c-cards h3 {
        font-family: var(--disp);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 19px;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        color: var(--text);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .c-cards p {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-wrap: pretty;
      }

      /* ── Contacto ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .c-contact {
        padding-top: 0;
      }
      .c-contact-card {
        display: grid;
        gap: 30px;
        padding: clamp(26px, 4vw, 46px);
        border-radius: 30px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
        background:
          radial-gradient(90% 120% at 8% 0%, rgba(122, 92, 255, 0.16), transparent 60%),
          linear-gradient(168deg, rgba(30, 27, 41, 0.94), rgba(17, 15, 25, 0.94));
        box-shadow:
          inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1),
          0 40px 90px -40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 1);
      }
      @media (min-width: 980px) {
        .c-contact-card {
          grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.92fr) minmax(0, 1.08fr);
          grid-template-areas:
            'lead form'
            'gh   form';
          align-items: start;
          column-gap: clamp(36px, 5vw, 72px);
          row-gap: 26px;
        }
        .c-contact-lead {
          grid-area: lead;
        }
        .c-form {
          grid-area: form;
        }
        .c-ghcard {
          grid-area: gh;
          align-self: end;
        }
      }
      .c-contact-lead {
        display: flex;
        gap: 18px;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
      .c-avatar {
        width: 72px;
        height: 72px;
        border-radius: 22px;
        object-fit: cover;
        object-position: 50% 22%;
        flex: none;
        border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
        box-shadow: 0 16px 30px -16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
      }
      .c-contact-lead h2 {
        font-family: var(--disp);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 34px);
        line-height: 1.08;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        color: var(--text);
        text-wrap: balance;
      }
      .c-contact-lead p {
        margin-top: 12px;
        font-size: 14.5px;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-wrap: pretty;
      }

      .c-form {
        display: grid;
        gap: 14px;
      }
      .c-row {
        display: grid;
        gap: 14px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 560px) {
        .c-row {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }
      }
      /* Etiqueta flotante: sube al enfocar o cuando el campo tiene contenido. */
      .c-field {
        position: relative;
      }
      .c-field input,
      .c-field textarea {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 24px 16px 11px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
        color: var(--text);
        font-family: var(--body);
        font-size: 15px;
        resize: vertical;
        transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
      }
      .c-field label {
        position: absolute;
        left: 17px;
        top: 17px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: var(--muted);
        pointer-events: none;
        transform-origin: left top;
        transition: transform 0.35s var(--spring), color 0.2s;
      }
      .c-field input:focus,
      .c-field textarea:focus {
        outline: none;
        border-color: rgba(122, 92, 255, 0.7);
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42);
      }
      .c-field input:focus + label,
      .c-field textarea:focus + label,
      .c-field input:not(:placeholder-shown) + label,
      .c-field textarea:not(:placeholder-shown) + label {
        transform: translateY(-9px) scale(0.76);
        color: #a99bff;
      }
      .c-form-foot {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px 20px;
        margin-top: 4px;
      }
      .c-mail {
        font-size: 13.5px;
        color: var(--muted);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding-bottom: 2px;
      }
      .c-mail:hover {
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .c-ghcard {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
        padding: 16px 18px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
        color: var(--muted);
        transition: background 0.25s, transform 0.45s var(--spring), border-color 0.25s;
      }
      .c-ghcard:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
        border-color: var(--line-2);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
      .c-ghcard span {
        display: grid;
        gap: 2px;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        line-height: 1.4;
      }
      .c-ghcard b {
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .c-ghcard em {
        margin-left: auto;
        font-style: normal;
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .c-foot {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px 26px;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 26px var(--gut) 40px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #625b7d;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        margin-top: 40px;
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .d-c *,
        .d-c *::before,
        .d-c *::after {
          transition-duration: 0.001ms !important;
          animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;
        }
        .d-c .c-card,
        .d-c .c-chip {
          transform: none !important;
        }
      }

      ::view-transition-group(*) {
        animation-duration: 0.42s;
        animation-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
